---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site, founder } from "../data/site";
import { breadcrumbs, ids } from "../lib/schema";

const description = `${founder.name} founded ${site.name} to build AI systems for operating businesses. Software engineer, operator and IESE MBA, based in Coimbatore, India.`;
---
<Base title="About" description={description} markdown="/about.md" schema={[
  { "@type": "AboutPage", "@id": `${site.url}/about/#page`, url: `${site.url}/about/`, name: `About ${site.name}`, mainEntity: { "@id": ids.person }, about: { "@id": ids.org } },
  breadcrumbs([{ name: "Home", path: "/" }, { name: "About", path: "/about/" }]),
]}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</p>
      <h1 class="display">Built by an operator, <em>not a vendor.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">{site.name} is a small practice. {founder.name} leads every engagement and brings in specialists where a job needs them.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>{founder.name}</h2>
        <p>{founder.summary}</p>
        <p>Most of what this site describes was tested first inside businesses Ajay runs: an HP and BenQ distribution business, a retail chain scaling past 150 stores, and a smartphone distribution territory. The methods came from the work, not the other way round.</p>
        <h2>Why the name</h2>
        <p>The useful work in a business happens where two things meet: operations and technology, a process and the person who owns it, a rule and its exception. That intersection is where we build.</p>
        <h2>How we decide what to build</h2>
        <p>We ask what a step costs today, who owns it, how often it goes wrong, and what happens when it does. If the answer is a spreadsheet or a policy change, we say so. If it is software, we build the smallest version that removes the step and measure it.</p>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>Founder</dt><dd>{founder.name}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>{site.location.city}, India</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Education</dt><dd>IESE MBA; CityU Hong Kong, Computer and Data Engineering</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Contact</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Elsewhere</dt><dd><a href={site.linkedin} rel="me noopener">LinkedIn</a> · <a href={site.github} rel="me noopener">GitHub</a></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-spacer"></div>
</Base>
